{"pageProps":{"note":{"id":"zettel.1777874908001","title":"Cross-session agent memory becomes a PII risk without governance","desc":"Long-lived LLM agent memory must be governed like sensitive storage, not treated as mere chat history.","tags":["permanent-note","agent","memory","privacy","pii","governance"],"created":1777874920043,"updated":1777948651853,"custom":{},"fname":"zettel.1777874908001","type":"note","vault":{"fsPath":"vault"},"contentHash":"26e61f18d172b2e923779df42824edee","links":[{"type":"frontmatterTag","from":{"fname":"zettel.1777874908001","id":"zettel.1777874908001","vaultName":"vault"},"value":"tags.permanent-note","alias":"permanent-note","xvault":false,"to":{"fname":"tags.permanent-note"}},{"type":"frontmatterTag","from":{"fname":"zettel.1777874908001","id":"zettel.1777874908001","vaultName":"vault"},"value":"tags.agent","alias":"agent","xvault":false,"to":{"fname":"tags.agent"}},{"type":"frontmatterTag","from":{"fname":"zettel.1777874908001","id":"zettel.1777874908001","vaultName":"vault"},"value":"tags.memory","alias":"memory","xvault":false,"to":{"fname":"tags.memory"}},{"type":"frontmatterTag","from":{"fname":"zettel.1777874908001","id":"zettel.1777874908001","vaultName":"vault"},"value":"tags.privacy","alias":"privacy","xvault":false,"to":{"fname":"tags.privacy"}},{"type":"frontmatterTag","from":{"fname":"zettel.1777874908001","id":"zettel.1777874908001","vaultName":"vault"},"value":"tags.pii","alias":"pii","xvault":false,"to":{"fname":"tags.pii"}},{"type":"frontmatterTag","from":{"fname":"zettel.1777874908001","id":"zettel.1777874908001","vaultName":"vault"},"value":"tags.governance","alias":"governance","xvault":false,"to":{"fname":"tags.governance"}},{"type":"wiki","from":{"fname":"zettel.1777874908001","id":"zettel.1777874908001","vaultName":"vault"},"value":"notes.security.pii-agent-architecture","position":{"start":{"line":20,"column":3,"offset":986},"end":{"line":20,"column":44,"offset":1027},"indent":[]},"xvault":false,"sameFile":false,"to":{"fname":"notes.security.pii-agent-architecture"}},{"from":{"fname":"notes.security.pii-agent-architecture","id":"notes.security.pii-agent-architecture","vaultName":"vault"},"type":"backlink","position":{"start":{"line":72,"column":3,"offset":7562},"end":{"line":72,"column":27,"offset":7586},"indent":[]},"value":"zettel.1777874908001"}],"anchors":{},"children":[],"parent":"zettel","data":{}},"body":"<h1 id=\"cross-session-agent-memory-becomes-a-pii-risk-without-governance\">Cross-session agent memory becomes a PII risk without governance<a aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"anchor-heading icon-link\" href=\"#cross-session-agent-memory-becomes-a-pii-risk-without-governance\"></a></h1>\n<blockquote>\n<p>Memory is not just chat history. For long-lived autonomous agents, memory is an architectural control plane that decides what to store, retrieve, update, and forget.</p>\n<p>Source: <a href=\"https://arxiv.org/html/2603.07670v1\">https://arxiv.org/html/2603.07670v1</a></p>\n</blockquote>\n<p>Catatan gue:</p>\n<ul>\n<li>Agent memory punya read path dan write path. Tanpa policy yang jelas, cross-session memory bisa mengakumulasi PII dan membentuk profil yang re-identifiable.</li>\n<li>Long context window bukan memory; memory harus bisa menilai relevansi, staleness, dan privacy scope.</li>\n<li>Untuk PII-safe agent, memory governance perlu filtering sebelum store, metadata tagging, evidence-based reflection, dan forgetting policy.</li>\n</ul>\n<p>Implikasi:</p>\n<ul>\n<li>Sistem security agent harus memperlakukan memory sebagai sumber data sensitif, bukan sekadar chat log.</li>\n<li>Episodic memory yang disimpan tanpa kontrol bisa jadi tempat PII tertumpuk dan kemudian direkonstruksi.</li>\n<li>Memory layer harus terintegrasi dengan retention policy, access scope, audit trail, dan kemampuan safe delete.</li>\n</ul>\n<p>Hubungan:</p>\n<ul>\n<li><a href=\"/sotoy/notes/notes.security.pii-agent-architecture\">Arsitektur PII filter dan security agent</a></li>\n</ul>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"tags\">Tags<a aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"anchor-heading icon-link\" href=\"#tags\"></a></h2>\n<ol>\n<li><a title=\"Private\" href=\"https://wiki.dendron.so/notes/hfyvYGJZQiUwQaaxQO27q.html\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"private\">permanent-note (Private)</a></li>\n<li><a title=\"Private\" href=\"https://wiki.dendron.so/notes/hfyvYGJZQiUwQaaxQO27q.html\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"private\">agent (Private)</a></li>\n<li><a title=\"Private\" href=\"https://wiki.dendron.so/notes/hfyvYGJZQiUwQaaxQO27q.html\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"private\">memory (Private)</a></li>\n<li><a title=\"Private\" href=\"https://wiki.dendron.so/notes/hfyvYGJZQiUwQaaxQO27q.html\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"private\">privacy (Private)</a></li>\n<li><a title=\"Private\" href=\"https://wiki.dendron.so/notes/hfyvYGJZQiUwQaaxQO27q.html\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"private\">pii (Private)</a></li>\n<li><a title=\"Private\" href=\"https://wiki.dendron.so/notes/hfyvYGJZQiUwQaaxQO27q.html\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"private\">governance (Private)</a></li>\n</ol>\n<hr>\n<strong>Backlinks</strong>\n<ul>\n<li><a href=\"/sotoy/notes/notes.security.pii-agent-architecture\">Arsitektur PII filter dan security agent</a></li>\n</ul>","noteIndex":{"id":"root","title":"Hello and Welcome! 👋","desc":"","updated":1778468084907,"created":1724251163400,"tags":["x","twitter"],"custom":{"nav_order":0,"permalink":"/"},"fname":"root","type":"note","vault":{"fsPath":"vault"},"contentHash":"fbada016be66dbd4790f7e49ede05b67","links":[{"type":"frontmatterTag","from":{"fname":"root","id":"root","vaultName":"vault"},"value":"tags.x","alias":"x","xvault":false,"to":{"fname":"tags.x"}},{"type":"frontmatterTag","from":{"fname":"root","id":"root","vaultName":"vault"},"value":"tags.twitter","alias":"twitter","xvault":false,"to":{"fname":"tags.twitter"}}],"anchors":{"find-more":{"type":"header","text":"Find More","value":"find-more","line":23,"column":0,"depth":2}},"children":["book-summaries","daily","handbook","notes","tags","til","zettel"],"parent":null,"data":{},"body":"\nWelcome to the homepage! I use Dendron to store and organize notes, ideas, and experiments I’m working on. Here are the main sections you’ll find on this site:\n\n1. **Learning Notes** — Practical notes on programming, recent technologies, and productivity tips.\n2. **Personal Projects** — Summaries of projects, experiments, and outcomes I’m working on or have completed.\n3. **Writings & Opinions** — Casual articles and reflections about technology, daily life, and other interesting topics.\n\nI’m constantly experimenting and learning. I hope the content here helps you as a reference, a starting point for discussion, or just light reading.\n\n> Why Dendron?\n>\nDendron helps keep notes organized. Its \"seed\" and \"vault\" concepts make it easy to structure content and find what you need.\n\n## Find More\n\nIf you want to learn more or connect, check these links:\n\n- [Homepage (Dendron)](https://zeihanaulia.github.io/sotoy/)\n- [My GitHub](https://github.com/zeihanaulia)\n- [My Twitter / X](https://x.com/zeihanaulia)\n\nThanks for stopping by. If you have feedback or want to chat, feel free to reach out.\n"},"collectionChildren":null,"customHeadContent":null,"config":{"version":5,"dev":{"enablePreviewV2":true},"commands":{"lookup":{"note":{"selectionMode":"extract","confirmVaultOnCreate":true,"vaultSelectionModeOnCreate":"smart","leaveTrace":false,"bubbleUpCreateNew":true,"fuzzThreshold":0.2}},"randomNote":{},"insertNoteLink":{"aliasMode":"none","enableMultiSelect":false},"insertNoteIndex":{"enableMarker":false},"copyNoteLink":{"aliasMode":"title"},"templateHierarchy":"template"},"workspace":{"dendronVersion":"0.83.0","vaults":[{"fsPath":"vault"}],"journal":{"dailyDomain":"daily","name":"journal","dateFormat":"y.MM.dd","addBehavior":"childOfDomain"},"scratch":{"name":"scratch","dateFormat":"y.MM.dd.HHmmss","addBehavior":"asOwnDomain"},"task":{"name":"","dateFormat":"","addBehavior":"childOfCurrent","statusSymbols"